DESIGN DECISIONS (parity-faithful)
  - /quick-stats is a STANDALONE web route (App.tsx L332), NOT a sidebar destination, so it is
    intentionally not added to the AppRoute sidebar/tab enum; QuickStatsRouteRegistration exposes
    the canonical path + a pure deep-link matcher + the hosted-page factory instead.
  - Strings use the established per-surface .strings table convention (every one of the ~1438
    staged feature-views does this; folds into Localizable.xcstrings at integration). The
    NSLocalizedString value: fallback guarantees the English default always renders. This keeps
    the change parallel-safe (no edit to the shared 4.6 MB catalog across concurrent slots).
  - The web <MetricCard color=...> prop only tints an icon box; this page passes no icon, so the
    colour is visually inert. Native tiles render neutrally for a faithful (not invented) parity.
  - No `import Shared` in any feature file (matches all existing feature-views); the KMP binding is
    a documented Source seam; previews/tests drive InMemoryQuickStatsSource.

